 chapter of the exciting storyline. Austin the butler is ready to welcome you to a world of incredible adventures!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGame Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e● Gameplay loved by millions of players! Make match-3 combinations and decorate your garden while enjoying an entertaining story!\\u003cbr\\u003e● Over 16,000 captivating levels with explosive power-ups, useful boosters, and cool elements.\\u003cbr\\u003e● Exciting events! Embark on fascinating Expeditions, compete against other players in different challenges, and win awesome prizes!\\u003cbr\\u003e● One-of-a-kind garden areas with unique layouts, from fountain ensembles to island landscapes.\\u003cbr\\u003e● Loads of fun characters: meet Austin\\u0026#39;s friends and neighbors!\\u003cbr\\u003e● Adorable pets that will become your faithful companions!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay with your Facebook friends, or make new friends in the game community!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGardenscapes is free to play, but some in-game elements (including randomized items) can be purchased for real money.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eA Wi-Fi or internet connection is not required to play.\\u003cbr\\u003e *An internet connection is required to access competitions and additional features.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDo you like Gardenscapes? Follow us!\\u003cbr\\u003eFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/Gardenscapes\\u003cbr\\u003eInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/gardenscapes_mobile/\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNeed to report an issue or ask a question? Contact Player Support through the game by going to Settings \\u0026gt; Help and Support. If you can\\u0026#39;t access the game, use the web chat by clicking the chat icon in the lower right corner of our website: https://playrix.helpshift.com/hc/en/5-gardenscapes/\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Use: https://playrix.com/terms/index_en.html\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://playrix.com/privacy/index_en.html\