iggy Kingdom\",[\"4.8\",4.832893],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.olleyo.piggy.king.free\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.olleyo.piggy.king.free\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.olleyo.piggy.king.free\"]],[\"qgJkGmIIDUoTCLXM77LHkJcDFSS6rAIdLhkZOPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNgogChpjb20ub2xsZXlvLnBpZ2d5LmtpbmcuZnJlZRABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Jingle-jingle, get your match 3 games - Piggy Kingdom ready to solve puzzles and get rewards. Match 3 games will leave happy emotions afterward. Piggy Kingdom will take you on an exciting journey where you will:\\u003cbr\\u003e• Solve puzzles\\u003cbr\\u003e• Match, swap and crush colors\\u003cbr\\u003e• Get tons of unique boosters\\u003cbr\\u003e• Rich rewards - accumulate points and exchange them for in-game goods\\u003cbr\\u003e• Hundreds of challenging, chilling, and funny levels\\u003cbr\\u003e• Beautiful animations, cheerful music\\u003cbr\\u003e• Lots of ways to kill time with fun and joy\\u003cbr\\u003e• Easy to play and win! Here is where we all feel fine!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIT IS NOT A WASTE OF TIME. Challenging yet enjoyable match 3 puzzle games where you need to train your brain by swiping colorful objects in shapes of three or more. It just sounds to be so easy.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSMILE AS YOU WATCH YOUR BOOSTERS DOING MAGIC. Every time you wisely move sweet colorful pieces together – the puzzle game will give you unique powerful boosters.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEVERY ATTEMPT IS APPRECIATED. Get rewards. Use accumulated boosters to finish a hard puzzle-solving game or keep them for the updated levels ahead.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEYE CANDY GRAPHICS + VISUALS. Your Piggy Kingdom game has never been so real. Boosters, puzzles, characters, surroundings, everything in this game looks so delightful.\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eWhen you see the board which you need to clear – things look so real. Some of them you even may find at home around you in real life. The puzzle solving \\u0026amp; color swiping match 3 game is here for you! Piggy Kingdom is waiting for you!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePIGGY AND THE CASTLE. The character\\u0026#39;s reactions are so funny to look at, and the castle has so many details to give a closer look at.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFROM BEGINNERS TO PROS! Your level of playing and solving match puzzle games can be different, but be sure, you will enjoy this match 3 game.\"],\"olleyo\",\"1,000,000+\",null,null,null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/BxWKHbbH7S2xDPAiu8aiiyurdUDvcjTD7w5LftCpe9yjWw4bulE6da3r62uBFYvKlB88rar_Gcuwn4yJr7rmag\"],null,[247,232,210,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.olleyo.piggy.king.free\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.olleyo.piggy.king.free\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $99.99