FyhY6cqfwCfhI2oEw-BgLHW0SDcPmcdHJAkIJgEeqqG4gPhOka0g\"]],[null,2,[2028,1280],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/jHGB3ubRuQP5XDV3RryCbkSxolMzj20Kozav4GL1c0Oh1c3PKYEFzpeUbZIbP1JKxuonEDbGkPX9XLFG-r3P\"]],[null,2,[2028,1280],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8nldTrkqiLXnUV1auQg46DUdL0E7ZxaRo1kcl-4kQ9B8LnQn7TbCeRvwxBxMrUbPHlZ5y5lOralE80hluDV8CQ\"]]],\"Farm Heroes Saga\",[\"4.6\",4.638642],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.king.farmheroessaga\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.king.farmheroessaga\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.king.farmheroessaga\"]],[\"qgJpGmcIFEoTCLXM77LHkJcDFSS6rAIdLhkZOPoBFwoVCL/v7NiSlLuNQxIJCgVlbi1VUxAAugIzCh0KF2NvbS5raW5nLmZhcm1oZXJvZXNzYWdhEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAB\"],[[[null,null,\"kUBmLHdX84A\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:kUBmLHdX84A?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:kUBmLHdX84A\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezn2EvadEj91bzgnVVw1IzgpbvzeBhXiQ2uZw178mwHiauYBkFtRItqFkZGX6R-ShZt9u6HnrzHk0rhE7MjEJwUHnOBSRnCwokkOMcbr7O8w4xM5pTnyGn__tSYopo6r6qSNRvEQg3TfJGNo3c5naLTyWv6kL9kgMFFB4KbNwRb8KlQ6nzETXpAESPoxEj5-vJ4AFEcK5494PFb4DiqdqanRU3auNf-0GNgddOgunS0LrukKLiCg1ZDNMv2ddUp7IdNKpEPLq2UEKOKQt9zy3AVCe-kK2ZrzuAwYEhrWgSOwbw\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/kUBmLHdX84A/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Farm Heroes Saga is a cheerful match 3 puzzle adventure that brings cropsies, farm charm, and playful challenges to every level. Match fruits, grow veggies, help your animal friends, and protect the land from Rancid the Raccoon as you play through bright levels made for relaxing breaks and satisfying wins.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🍓Welcome to the farm\\u003cbr\\u003eThis is a feel-good puzzle game with a light farming spirit at its heart. Farm Heroes Saga stands out among farm games with sunny fields, playful challenges, and rewarding matching that keeps every level fresh without feeling too intense.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 Features to enjoy\\u003cbr\\u003e- Play match 3 levels filled with fruits, flowers, suns, water drops, and veggies\\u003cbr\\u003e- Explore farm games with charming animals, cozy settings, and playful goals\\u003cbr\\u003e- Use boosters to blast challenging boards, collect Magic Beans, and improve your score through smart matching\\u003cbr\\u003e- Enjoy offline play when you want to unwind anywhere\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌱 How the fun grows\\u003cbr\\u003eEach puzzle gives you clear goals, simple controls, and plenty of cheerful farm energy. Matching cropsies boosts their value, helps you clear tricky boards, and keeps the harvest moving. Whether you already enjoy match 3 games or just want a relaxing puzzle escape, the game feels easy to pick up and rewarding to keep playing.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🍏More to do every day\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin Farm Club, get help from friendly animals, and hop into daily rewards, team play, and special events. The farming theme stays front and center, with fields to protect, crops to gather, and lots of matching moments to enjoy. Offline access also makes it easy to keep the fun going on the road or during a quick break.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✈️ Frequently asked questions\\u003cbr\\u003eWhat is Farm Heroes Saga?\\u003cbr\\u003eFarm Heroes Saga is a casual match 3 puzzle game from King where matching cropsies helps save the farm and complete each level.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCan I play without wifi?\\u003cbr\\u003eYes. Many parts of the game can be played offline, so you can enjoy the farm wherever you are.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhat makes it special?\\u003cbr\\u003eIts mix of cheerful farming style, bright fruits, fun puzzle design, cute animals, and relaxing progression makes matching feel fresh and friendly.\\u003cbr\\u003eStart your Farm Heroes Saga adventure today and enjoy match 3 fun, bright puzzle levels, and farm games packed with country charm.\\u003cbr\\u003eVisit https://community.king.com/en or contact us in-game by going to Settings \\u0026gt; Customer Care if you need help!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFarm Heroes Saga is free to play but optional in-game items such as extra moves or lives require payment. You can turn off the payment feature by disabling in-app purchases in your device’s settings.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBy downloading Farm Heroes Saga you agree to our terms of service which can be found at https://king.com/termsAndConditions\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDo not sell my data: King shares your personal information with advertising partners to personalize ads. Learn more at https://king.com/privacyPolicy. If you wish to exercise your Do Not Sell My Data rights, you can do so by contacting us via the in-game help center or by going to https://soporto.king.com/contact\"],\"King\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xcBjEgOIqb7RIL_ua4XNDvLykle8TLaCuycouhR2kgJ25-4pYVazIpPaYtMfTYWBfacSyZTSbw2BVjbt5s_E\"],null,[237,166,77,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"Users Interact, Shares Info, Digital Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\