 would explore territories, build houses or even entire villages; farm, harvest, or maybe you would conquer new lands.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eYou have an opportunity to be on a desert island together with the heroes of the Family Island game and try yourself in different roles: farmer, cook, explorer, trader and many others. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eInterested? Here are some more features of our game:\\u003cbr\\u003e★ \\u003cb\\u003eExplore\\u003c/b\\u003e  wild territories, solve puzzles, find hidden objects and  set on a thrilling adventure to new islands.\\u003cbr\\u003e★ \\u003cb\\u003eBuild\\u003c/b\\u003e and improve your little city in the middle of the ocean.\\u003cbr\\u003e★ \\u003cb\\u003eStart your own family farm!\\u003c/b\\u003e Harvest, grow crops and craft useful goods to trade with other characters.\\u003cbr\\u003e★ \\u003cb\\u003eCook\\u003c/b\\u003e healthy and tasty food from the ingredients that you can find on the island.\\u003cbr\\u003e★ \\u003cb\\u003eCustomize\\u003c/b\\u003e your village with beautiful decorations! Choose flowers and plants that match the unusual landscapes of your village.\\u003cbr\\u003e★ \\u003cb\\u003eMeet\\u003c/b\\u003e unusual animals: island hamsters, wild goats and even a dinosaur are waiting for you!\\u003cbr\\u003e★ \\u003cb\\u003eHelp\\u003c/b\\u003e a family survive on a desert island. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAnd that is not all! Family Island is a farm game full of unexpected twists and captivating adventure!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFollow Family Island on Facebook and Instagram for exclusive offers and bonuses!\\u003cbr\\u003eFacebook: facebook.com/familyislandgame/\\u003cbr\\u003eInstagram: instagram.com/familyislandgame/\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Service: https://static.moonactive.net/legal/terms.html?lang\\u003den\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Notice: https://static.moonactive.net/legal/privacy.html?lang\\u003den\\u003cbr\\u003eThe game contains in-game purchases (including randomized items)\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eQuestions about the game? Our support is ready and waiting at:  https://melsoft-games.helpshift.com/hc/en/11-family-island/\"],\"Melsoft Games Ltd\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yW-Q0E-ntIf0KbcaTfIZn6WYIwLvkqa2gwaVWRPIbyy3zrHodlRSd9d_hSHwhqGwY74xBoQQn55pdL-BlPm4fw\"],null,[140,212,167,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],[null,\"Comic Mischief\"],[null,\"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.MelsoftGames.FamilyIslandFarm\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.MelsoftGames.FamilyIslandFarm\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $149.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.crazylabs.fashion.squad\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/g2nIc_OPSy3JLw8lgVvWCpJSsoorengpP1h70ktPZIv_x7SselgFd45FO_xZ0ANT2HSZPo_TBSHtchphJJpgmA\"],null,[149,215,250,255],null,null,nul