https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ryS3i6p26evx_ja3V-JPiQrqpswXwzMaVo43sn7MjZTKzZN_OzJjsRsQzKGBa5VuD3SIV0L3xNVnuT4swzEW_w\"]],[null,2,[1450,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/DwK2h7wY-febqha_CSbOm99gJLAUvRAjhqaz7VhT83vN8P0_TN1ma7GY0kXXnzhN3i8apJk3mJ0rPJHWXBd4J14\"]],[null,2,[1440,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/z8OXkOi1uSJAE_Y1qd42Z2Ps37_udcX7cC5X6EZsugB1S-E_3DeS0S9iGu1M16H9y4KPF7fiz19Zyc3LYqw-NPg\"]],[null,2,[1440,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/LNybukvlFv1mNoNS6DhM84J395SrpdN4-1t67eHEuoMqvQJhH8RaBA9o94Mp1ERfZhsAQ0LViF6XlDSvPVObyA\"]],[null,2,[1450,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/qHFBdfXgKVXbdi-DIe7V2yhDrA92-ZHKb6loD2I3zOFvrzjPyijeO0vrOuUIqAwz77aviQHCc_kg9liJ_UKq\"]]],\"Mistfall Match: Design \\u0026 Blast\",[\"4.9\",4.8694158],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.merge.match3mystery\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.merge.match3mystery\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.merge.match3mystery\"]],[\"qgJhGl8IJUoTCLXM77LHkJcDFSS6rAIdLhkZOPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCMwodChdjb20ubWVyZ2UubWF0Y2gzbXlzdGVyeRABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"lMiOCj8mZQw\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:lMiOCj8mZQw?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:lMiOCj8mZQw\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezk0mv7CkCM9sJ4k3OQ1ct1optJelUH6-qNu4uj-gHOhcvnZNIaGM14CANt0abKDRpGjGBu3-X94OTDSY_yPgdkajhR2JIZ7Ne_Np9gvTeyS77bLvcdcYtOsQBLmEBzkUIggezIifqqOMMoFAIbgAo3ls0n_ZKa0yUcGiZt-SYS5izx8yO0-3r1wuJ8PhiyknqVNQzQGcrhriOyFGimhihaYSl_aOZAUnXtMXaPpyc2RLne54L8rIZPD3JeaqXEv-Zur__N21Z683G5FuxQ2iMJUrDbcB-PCEtQ7bCiX4YXAFw\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/lMiOCj8mZQw/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Welcome to Mistfall Match, where the magic of garden merging meets the thrill of match-3 puzzle gameplay! Create your own enchanting garden paradise in this relaxing puzzle adventure.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMerge \\u0026amp; Grow Your Magical Garden Collect seeds, merge plants, and discover rare flowers and garden items. Combine elements to unlock new species and watch your blooming garden flourish! Enjoy the calm and satisfaction of garden design and flower matching.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSolve Challenging Match-3 Puzzles Put your puzzle skills to the test! Play fun match-3 levels to earn valuable resources, boosters, and power-ups. Each puzzle level brings exciting challenges to overcome. It\\u0026#39;s the perfect blend of brain-teasing action and strategic matching!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBuild \\u0026amp; Upgrade Your Garden Kingdom Use your hard-earned rewards to build, upgrade, and decorate stunning garden buildings and landmarks. Customize every corner of your dream garden oasis, from cozy cottages to sparkling fountains. Experience the joy of garden building sim and home design.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e Key Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e•Merge Game: Combine plants and items to grow your collection.\\u003cbr\\u003e•Match-3 Game: Solve addictive puzzles for resources and rewards.\\u003cbr\\u003e•Garden Building Sim: Construct and upgrade beautiful structures.\\u003cbr\\u003e•Garden Design: Create your perfect, personalized garden layout.\\u003cbr\\u003e•Relaxing Puzzle Game: Enjoy calm, stress-free gameplay.\\u003cbr\\u003e•Flower Matching: Discover and collect gorgeous blooms.\\u003cbr\\u003e•Island Design: Decorate your island buildings.\\u003cbr\\u003e•Free to Play: Download now and start building!\\u003cbr\\u003e•Unlock Boosters \\u0026amp; Power-ups: Use special items to conquer tricky levels.\\u003cbr\\u003e•Garden Makeover: Transform your space into a magical retreat.\\u003cbr\\u003e•Puzzle Adventure: Progress through exciting worlds and challenges.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMistfall Match offers a unique blend of garden game, merge puzzle, and match-3 mechanics that will keep you hooked. Whether you love designing gardens, solving puzzles, or watching your creations grow, this game has something for everyone. Experience the serene beauty and engaging gameplay today!\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Mistfall Match for free and start your journey to create the ultimate garden escape!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eOur Facebook page:  https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id\\u003d61568566320112.\"],\"Flyyes, Inc.\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/jLHBeGx7PJvO4iPQcjUcApOUZ7G8yHvWMyYhHHj5J0JT3FnplQH6i8vuMAdr61v5hDWHqFQUfzOLdow3pzbh0Q\"],null,[100,203,253,255]],null,[\"Everyone 10+\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/csiz76udPjXmaJddU_1sanHGlQAAbKkvlprK3DSUNmwu1nY3U6qnXRrI2IDMaivooYK1x11oxz3PEO4z\"]],[null,\"Mild Violence\"],[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bxs95MghtAOuZR_LPwVCUmUPYEvXsGVOH3chF1OCX0-Ns_S0qdHnzml2CGCgOGbYlftKsmt9gtpxLb8U\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.merge.match3mystery\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.merge.match3mystery\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.09 - $99.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"