FP6AVybAxAA3LpVBww_0wK_j5v2hdMXufPe6LkAloonnBHYs1TGG2D\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/RXgL4JFZN_TSwssAEjVIeOLphbEMV__XlB32LTm0YxR9opqrrj-d5FlG03qHGIjj-RprXjwNLKi43zUgnV9MdVI\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Eb2VpegjtLlM17N7Ga1Ux0lr-1PZJYUQGjy56B4bw_2dLQHZ1Qorq4qEcJdOheHAgCxtN6BUSTK11L_jJwpsSA\"]]],\"Last Light\",[\"4.1\",4.0650687],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.lighthouse.freeplay.ameuno\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.lighthouse.freeplay.ameuno\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.lighthouse.freeplay.ameuno\"]],[\"qgJoGmYIKUoTCLXM77LHkJcDFSS6rAIdLhkZOPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCOgokCh5jb20ubGlnaHRob3VzZS5mcmVlcGxheS5hbWV1bm8QARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"In a world ravaged by the undead, where humanity\\u0026#39;s last embers flicker in the shadows of ruin, will you rise as the architect of mankind\\u0026#39;s final stand? Welcome to Last Light – the ultimate test of strategy and will in the face of annihilation.\\u003cbr\\u003e  \\u003cbr\\u003eUnscrew \\u0026amp; remove\\u003cbr\\u003ePlease unscrew all screws in the order shown in the diagram until all parts are removed! Tip: The order is crucial. Different disassembly methods may lead to different results. So it\\u0026#39;s best to consider this carefully beforehand!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBuild \\u0026amp; Defend\\u003cbr\\u003eEstablish your stronghold in the heart of the apocalypse. Construct fortified walls, set up vital resource stations, and develop advanced technologies to withstand the relentless tide of the undead. Every building you raise and every defense you reinforce could mean the difference between survival and extinction.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eManage \\u0026amp; Adapt\\u003cbr\\u003eTake command of a community of survivors—each with unique skills, traits, and burdens. Assign roles, manage morale, and make life-or-death decisions to keep your sanctuary running. But beware: in this broken world, danger doesn’t only come from the outside.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eExplore \\u0026amp; Reclaim\\u003cbr\\u003eSend expeditions into the ruins of the old world. Scavenge for supplies, uncover hidden lore, and encounter other survivors—some willing to trade, others to betray. Expand your influence, reclaim lost territories, and uncover the dark secrets behind the outbreak.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAlliance \\u0026amp; Domination\\u003cbr\\u003eForge alliances with players worldwide. Coordinate attacks, share resources, and unite to conquer zombie hordes and enemy factions. Together, you can rebuild not just a shelter—but a new civilization.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe end of the world is only the beginning. Will you merely survive… or will you lead humanity into a new dawn?\"],\"Dinosaur-Games\",\"500,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/PQusW4bzKnGe3V3JoLhEU4EEYVp3Yl47xj4OVTB0b0ZBUF6YYfaey73DZnTj-K5u8z4vYW2rAYyOKFgaJ7Wj\"],null,[239,223,207,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"