ovie:IgTaB-tShew?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:IgTaB-tShew\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezkOZWL71fxzOw8P8uWWRze9SNCVBAdx6xGJyVEfsFUkRB_RNae3RzZn7zOkhgNddh4Skber_ctdN9vuOhJqbvC-KwL4gBNNMbY7VdqjvfGU_0pubYstej8SniqfKdl1pDxIcjEiWgYpItqtDqlUYghPJem2h3aVuDApoa2mBMJyUQBtklt-geL3tXDc3M76kPLUeJynQssfzKrO5wvtG9b9ZGIWN2PwxAntxyAxN4A8lasZMYTssnANshWfU-r7yDMusTUIpF2S05vfuMjnG1Ne-5m2l6-45WClYcCEswsfnw\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/IgTaB-tShew/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"\\u0026quot;You don\\u0026#39;t see them... but they see you.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eYou’re an orphan, raised by a wandering feng shui master who found you near a graveyard. Before he died, he handed you a locked box—the only clue to your past. After burying him, you begin your journey to uncover the truth.\\u003cbr\\u003eYour first lead brings you to a run-down apartment building. You move in as a tenant—but something is deeply wrong.\\u003cbr\\u003e- The elevator opens by itself—on floors no one pressed.\\u003cbr\\u003e- An empty unit echoes with whispers that don’t exist.\\u003cbr\\u003e- A cursed construction site keeps taking lives...\\u003cbr\\u003eWhat starts as a ghost story becomes something far more disturbing.\\u003cbr\\u003eBecause sometimes, the real horror isn’t the ghost—it’s the people.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGame Features:\\u003cbr\\u003eFace your fears and uncover long-buried secrets\\u003cbr\\u003eMerge clues to reveal hidden truths\\u003cbr\\u003eLook closely - every detail could crack the case\\u003cbr\\u003eSolve puzzles and relax through a hauntingly original experience\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDare to look deeper?\\u003cbr\\u003eYour parents are gone. But why?\\u003cbr\\u003eIs it a curse… or a cover-up?\\u003cbr\\u003eCan you tell what’s real - and what’s a setup?\\u003cbr\\u003eThe deaths keep coming. Accidents? Or something worse?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePerfect for players who:\\u003cbr\\u003eLove creepy folktales and chilling mysteries\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy merge mechanics with a twist\\u003cbr\\u003eAre drawn to stories about the dark side of human nature\\u003cbr\\u003eThis is your only way out.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Haunted Merge: Horror Story\\u003cbr\\u003eMerge the evidence. Uncover the truth.\\u003cbr\\u003eExpose the terrifying secrets buried behind every story they tried to erase.\\u0026quot;\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFacebook:\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://www.facebook.com/HauntedMergeGames\"],\"WhaleJoy Game Limited\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0J-mq5H4QCThfEQvEoKHXaxMMob0O6a0FxJfT5WvqXTbBLOtZwwhmy3eewvCOJkmznnuykYnYu424DPKBYUq5w\"],null,[18,20,18,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Mild Violence, Drug Reference\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xl04GurQer374yogi24hRkvUcXtMStMOcOo86Sprmrid9j6wQHF0d9xMh73CwUEg57lbsGIwpOXgrJ927Q\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.whalejoy.horrorstory.gp\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.whalejoy.horrorstory.gp\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.49 - $99.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,nu