3cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe frost may have slowed things down, but with a little help, warmth and color are ready to return.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMerge items, follow story steps, and enjoy watching each frozen corner feel alive again.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAlong the way, you’ll meet friends who are starting over and happy to have your help.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMerge to Discover\\u003cbr\\u003eTap, drag, and merge to uncover bigger, better, and more exciting items.\\u003cbr\\u003eCollect merged items to advance chapters, unlock new scenes, and restore each space step by step.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRestore to Revive\\u003cbr\\u003eFix up frosty homes and make each space feel warm and welcoming again.\\u003cbr\\u003eEach repair opens new rooms and scenes, gently showing the valley coming back to life.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay to Reward\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin cozy in-game events with new characters, festive themes, and fun little stories.\\u003cbr\\u003eCollect special rewards that add fun surprises and new moments to enjoy.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStart your journey today and help Frost Valley find its warmth again—one merge at a time.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://www.liteorange.co/ps.html\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Service: https://www.liteorange.co/terms.html\"],\"Tuyoo Games (HK) Limited\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/nxjFTKu2zkGda6GGffv2Fa_2HREVW6m3EkpHszyPQhglvZww9-g0zi4T7vj2I4dSnIzZsu__ZLomxM71bo5IxA\"],null,[196,210,216,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Violence, Blood, Language\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,