PPEk26Bps-vUMurfYSl-h8d0q_Eo_Ozt5mPPSNlpBZ4vFwwz8f0eK14sYdpWj5-rRgdTO324FFxsCDIgO-\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/eyfR-v70IDTFZhOLNKGfePYKsib0PXGDtO4K4COJnX0oeY9_xuXL1bxFRD7CD7pNMeVE60BCVHM1qtxC8LzS\"]]],\"Fish of Fortune™\",[\"4.8\",4.7669864],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.whalo.games.fishoffortune\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.whalo.games.fishoffortune\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.whalo.games.fishoffortune\"]],[\"qgJnGmUINUoTCLXM77LHkJcDFSS6rAIdLhkZOPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCOQojCh1jb20ud2hhbG8uZ2FtZXMuZmlzaG9mZm9ydHVuZRABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"2zD1hGlXkUA\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:2zD1hGlXkUA?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:2zD1hGlXkUA\",null,[1920,1080],null,null,\"AXH1ezncJmZ6bP-1_sd3ojlZocbHahfE6Cm9p0drukZFMGrEXrqYtB0S7piQMJbbrJz0UjBKRQK2FyRp6V5qCjNEIlxJEDYP0tG7R3dLV5jzASP9ID5yJePiVkmLrzKNhfH1-QlQcXjYOuohBmajehZS-yyBU21_e6CraJcUEsmxCouylTefMyg2N15BjsUor2GmOcalvJZITat9zlRou4hXATgfd3kvdn61hE9au2Rmrhgpb2R9l8FQGZr67WF51qCIsS5thIMF6uEV3iRRwmq8UJC7enQqEmKoNLcH_UmN6jN2eA\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/2zD1hGlXkUA/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"\\u003cb\\u003eEmbark on a New Fishing Game Adventure!\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSpin the wheel of fortune to get coins and unlock magical sea creatures 🐠! Win rewards 🏆, catch fish 🐟, raid 🏴\\u200d☠️, loot treasure 💎, and attack your friends ⚔️ while you restore and build your island 🏝️ in this exciting fishing game. Enjoy this arcade fishing game with the Captain and his Pingo crew 🐧.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLooking for multiplayer fun? In Fish of Fortune, you can play solo or play with friends, raid and attack their island ⚔️ 🏝️ as you compete for fishing game glory and become the fishing master! Take a classic fishing game, give it a coin game twist, and add fun multiplayer mechanics. Raid your friends 🏴\\u200d☠️ and gather energy to build your dream island 🏝️!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eNot Your Average Fishing Game\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFish of Fortune is a unique fishing game 🐟 mixed with a thrilling island adventure 🏝️. Raid friends 🏴\\u200d☠️, loot treasure 💎, collect coins, and spin the wheel to unlock special rewards 🏆 in this one-of-a-kind fishing game!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eSpin the Wheel of Fortune to Earn Loot!\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSpin the wheel to reveal your fortune! Will you land on attack time ⚔️, loot 💎, shields 🛡️, raid 🏴\\u200d☠️, puzzle 🧩, coins? The possibilities are endless! Earn coins to upgrade and build your island 🏝️ and advance through fish levels 🐟 in this thrilling fishing game. Earn shields 🛡️ to protect your island from other players trying to attack ⚔️. Become the fishing coin master 🏆 with the strongest island 🏝️ and the most loot in this epic fishing game adventure!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eEarn Free Coins in Your Fishing Game!\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCollect coins by spinning the wheel and use them to restore 🛠️, decorate, and build islands 🏝️. If you’re feeling lazy 😴—like a fish 🐟 out of water—you can use the autospin mode 🔄 to collect coins while you sit back and relax in your fishing game world! Attack and raid islands 🏝️ to steal loot 💎 and become the wealthiest fisherman in the game!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eLet the Fishing Game Raid Games Commence!\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSpinning the wheel isn’t the only way to win! ⚔️ Attack friends, raid them 🏴\\u200d☠️, and loot their island 🏝️ to steal treasures 🏆 and coins in this competitive fishing game! Become the coin champion 🏆 of this exciting multiplayer fishing game adventure!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003ePlay with Friends in This Epic Fishing Game!\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin the best fishing Captain, cute Pingos 🐧, and big fish 🐟 in this fun coin game! Spin the wheel to earn coins, raid your friend’s island, and build your fishing game island 🏝️ to be the strongest of all. Join our growing Fortune Fishers community 🐟 on Facebook to play together, meet new fish friends, earn big rewards 🏆 in this cool fishing game!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eCollect All the Fish Cards in This Fishing Game!\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIt’s not just about loot 💎, it’s also about collecting treasures 🏆! Spin the wheel to gather and upgrade dozens of fish cards featuring characters from Fish of Fortune 🐟 in this incredible fishing game!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFollow Fish of Fortune on Facebook for exclusive offers and bonuses in this fantastic fishing game!\\u003cbr\\u003eFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/FishOfFortune\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSomething fishy in the air? Having problems?\\u003cbr\\u003ePlease contact us in the game by clicking on the menu \\u0026gt; Settings \\u0026gt; Support or email us at support@whalo.com.\"],\"Whalo\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/QAkSD8Wi3LA3WQZ9HJG_bPr-9PmV083h5Q5yEhbqPAv9VLTfw6v7fbwkJqB1P5Ufbna6avYCmDY5rAeBPvL4zA\"],null,[126,240,242,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],[null,\"Mild Fantasy Violence\"],[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9