vW_pND-DKQb1qW__wjgWYy\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_wp_g99LBUH0Svom7ACQxPM23WUDvuq6mm1hU3UR994DaBiFVjLRpBCwcqXSFkSRR0dNExmQbVeJaPZCJq4fqGI\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/lxa3vo3eBiyKopdWTqyf5NY6rrRPrMrNk5a9JcYP3X_eyeR8Avocm-vVH0dA5vTkziUfoN4G6yX6O0olcB-vcg\"]]],\"Screw Tap Jam™: Screw Puzzle\",[\"4.8\",4.8271265],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dscrew.pin.sort.jam.puzzle.nuts\\u0026rdid\\u003dscrew.pin.sort.jam.puzzle.nuts\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dscrew.pin.sort.jam.puzzle.nuts\"]],[\"qgJoGmYINkoTCLXM77LHkJcDFSS6rAIdLhkZOPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCOgokCh5zY3Jldy5waW4uc29ydC5qYW0ucHV6emxlLm51dHMQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAE\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"3Z5gJ9xW4w0\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:3Z5gJ9xW4w0?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:3Z5gJ9xW4w0\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezn7ojasJoonDJNdE0RahJrCg0fg9xQ5fTuKVZECw-6YRzNPE4FPeDIxPY7pIbmqenYsIOzSo7Bh1Cyx8Wgo7uzHXptN2PC302OcZV0gd7H3mjiqg64MU5nRpj7Zhdr_3coK_Qw2ggJvDqlMQPrFxizBzehcvycN1eMX0OPw9EbbiClIAX03eHfQZ7xMyjos3Yk81A76GIFpiYWHdXt0VE1D0Txk24J9Ns-aXbAFXB8IBLwzhi2Fd9Ehsqe_lKPcUYz48JMxonez4XjtqczFmyUIJkVXsO600qHv661nxtmEmw\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3Z5gJ9xW4w0/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Get ready to screw sort and tackle the thrilling nuts and bolts screw puzzle! 🛠️ Say goodbye to boring, static 2D unscrew games and embrace the 3d unscrew pin excitement! Dive into this screw out casual game that combines the thrill of 3D nuts and bolts screw puzzle with the satisfaction of screw sort jam.\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eCasual unscrew games Gameplay:\\u003cbr\\u003eIn screw games, you’ll face a variety of playful 3d unscrew cartoon models, each fastened by color-matched screw pin. Unlock the joy of 3d screw puzzle-solving as you skillfully unscrew puzzle pieces by removing screw out in groups. Release yourself from the 3D unscrew puzzle, rotate the 3D nuts and bolts and strategically plan your moves in each sort screw puzzle to detach and diminish all screws. Victory of unscrew puzzle means leaving the model completely screw-less, mastering each level of the 3d unscrew journey of screw games one turn at a time!\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eGame Features of Screw Tap Jam: Sort screw puzzle\\u003cbr\\u003e- Custom Angles: Rotate freely to complete unscrew puzzle challenges and become a 3d unscrew expert and screw master.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Innovative Match 3 Mechanics: Enjoy the fresh twist of merging puzzle-solving with nuts and bolts screw games perfection.\\u003cbr\\u003e- 3D nuts and bolts: More realistic physical 3d screw puzzle, brand new sort screw puzzle experience of screw games!\\u003cbr\\u003e- Adorable Models: Get hooked on various delightful items of 3D screw puzzle that need your skillful touch in the 3d unscrew games.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Master of screw games: Triumph in the screw sort puzzle universe and solve unscrew puzzle as the masterful disassembler and screw sort master. 🌟\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eElevate your 3D screw puzzle-solving game with Screw Tap Jam: Screw Sort 3D today. No angle limit, rotate 3D nuts and bolts as you wish. Can you unscrew everything and conquer the intricacies of the nuts and bolts sort screw puzzle and unscrew puzzle? Let the unscrew games with screw out jam puzzle be your playground! ⚙️\"],\"Shinrays Games\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/jd_XsQzzdn1NdbNvhwVud4KwstgnT_tWhVa-a1Xw2fkTiNGKMTWnHULPJoX4XUhGW-CsoPnfgZxOH0GOq5a7lQ\"],null,[133,217,239,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,