ysteries of the void\\u003cbr\\u003e- Strengthen your power, and form alliances with others to receive the greatest support!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eContact Us - FACEBOOK: https://www.facebook.com/HeroclashOfficial\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e* This game is free to play, but it offers in-app purchases for virtual game currency, items, and other paid services. Please make moderate purchases based on personal interests and financial capability.\\u003cbr\\u003e* Please be mindful of your gaming time to avoid addiction. Prolonged gameplay may disrupt your routine, so it\\u0026#39;s advisable to take regular breaks and engage in physical activities.\"],\"Glaciers Game\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/FJoAuxnYwcVlSWoFN9SrgAKfBXbtoMJXQVsdhGCXpNwrrjGrJ5l6ACOVYdHJL5muwMm8og78Fua3SX9rW9Tg8mc\"],null,[150,210,101,255]],null,[\"Everyone 10+\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/csiz76udPjXmaJddU_1sanHGlQAAbKkvlprK3DSUNmwu1nY3U6qnXRrI2IDMaivooYK1x11oxz3PEO4z\"]],[null,\"Fantasy Violence, Suggestive Themes\"],[null,\"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bxs95MghtAOuZR_LPwVCUmUPYEvXsGVOH3chF1OCX0-Ns_S0qdHnzml2CGCgOGbYlftKsmt9gtpxLb8U\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.xgame.newglobal.na.gp\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.xgame.newglobal.na.gp\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false