re/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.puzzle.sand.fill.aos\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.puzzle.sand.fill.aos\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.puzzle.sand.fill.aos\"]],[\"qgJiGmAIO0oTCLXM77LHkJcDFSS6rAIdLhkZOPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNAoeChhjb20ucHV6emxlLnNhbmQuZmlsbC5hb3MQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"🖼️ A picture made of colored sand is on the wall. Time to take it apart.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eA block puzzle where color and shape both matter.\\u003cbr\\u003e🧱 Pick a block, place it on the grid below the picture, and sand of the same color pours into it.\\u003cbr\\u003e💯 When a block hits 100%, it disappears and the space opens up again.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔲 The right color is not enough — the shape has to fit.\\u003cbr\\u003eLook at the open cells, count what is left, and save room for the block you will need next.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ When the last grain is gone, the picture disappears and a new one goes up.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSimple, but you keep going. Pick, place, repeat.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⭐ HIGHLIGHTS\\u003cbr\\u003e👆 One-tap controls — pick, place, done.\\u003cbr\\u003e🌈 Color matching — each block only absorbs its own color.\\u003cbr\\u003e🔲 Space management — the color can match and the shape still won\\u0026#39;t fit.\\u003cbr\\u003e💯 Fill meter — see how full every block is at a glance.\\u003cbr\\u003e🖼️ Sand pictures — a new one on the wall every stage.\\u003cbr\\u003e🧰 Items — stuck? Hammer, magnet, vacuum.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧩 Made for people who like block puzzles.\\u003cbr\\u003eThe picture is up. So, where does this one go?\"],\"Stormborn Inc.\",\"100,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/WJ6zlxh6QzFKdhufynQFkgEbgo_0yoOfMaj1lXtDfToGdHzr-eMpvP0cGZvLP1yNHbKTVhj8OGA3Ihfs