ZrXWT3Vrnc8eG-_xcC-7I64Yad9i-I_uoyav6FpdkK3P8S4vDzBzrwJ5n3kfZo\"]],[null,2,[1280,2028],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yClNhv4OYuVnT7P7e_7oaJCFrcsr5SXbSQ_A4nKX2fNorm7BiOCFdFyxLFRGWrG5DDrQovT8PrGmCWbAyXdy\"]],[null,2,[1280,2028],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/759kF_2TNAtbytf6a5GpaDbQhBkxLlCjI4zeayiLyAGAVhRYBNHprvfPiHFkYz7KcRwa-R_uDwwc47fo8vRuWQ\"]],[null,2,[1280,2028],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/fxfAP12v11q9MxQoDWYOzjOvBODh3PSUuiQgUrmF65HEuhGcTmU235iW0FbVSGWacvRVfXvgh9cp5QA0jraz8LQ\"]]],\"Candy Crush Friends Saga\",[\"4.7\",4.6735053],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.king.candycrush4\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.king.candycrush4\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.king.candycrush4\"]],[\"qgJmGmQIPkoTCLXM77LHkJcDFSS6rAIdLhkZOPoBFwoVCMb8j4/KjbiMQxIJCgVlbi1VUxAAugIwChoKFGNvbS5raW5nLmNhbmR5Y3J1c2g0EAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAB\"],[[[null,null,\"bYYFHCmPVRs\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:bYYFHCmPVRs?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:bYYFHCmPVRs\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezlk10sHlc7Lyw2t9i_zKOWDxKMoWU88gMcjIl8iCv8NCAbzkmdyHEfJaHSXdYf2p_JmWZZskDUtl7sl2BtK8wQmhkI_a_pScdYwwW3ClZSdRYf487P8Dsq1yp_6oSOc1LtBZZfykTHD8OOyx6M1uFl_JaQa5gTz75Hi75yptLEVsVRzKXWoIN_7-0rsbjj-B_24G0FVZ420EonPpyVq_t3s-BxqxnKy26v5fv4MGE0umdAdQr4Mqx96Bz9MgUievJy8yRFFQsMb6KYnW5n_tAF3wqwYFDn0RaFARUDwYfMTlQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/bYYFHCmPVRs/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"With updated graphics, fun new game modes and a host of friends to help you blast through hundreds of levels!\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eYour Candy Crush Friends have been scattered throughout the Candy Kingdom - Join this match 3 puzzle game to find them! This friendly bunch have their own unique powers to help you to create sweet candy combinations and blastthrough blockers!\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eSwitch and match candies to unlock rewards, friends, and sweet collectable outfits! The more candies you collect the greater your power on the game board!\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eThis fun new Candy game is filled with delicious treats - cookies, jam, chocolate and more! Your favourite game modes, but sweeter than ever!\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eCandy Crush Friends Saga features: \\u003cbr\\u003e•\\tHundreds of levels to play – collect your favorite friends along the way! \\u003cbr\\u003e•\\tYour Candy friends are your allies – they are ready to help you blast through levels!\\u003cbr\\u003e•\\tWatch Yeti and his friends dance when you win levels!\\u003cbr\\u003e•\\tFun new game modes; dunk the cookie in the chocolate \\u0026amp; free the octopuses and the mammoths!  \\u003cbr\\u003e•\\tKeep your friends in a sticker book and change their outfits!\\u003cbr\\u003e•\\tExplore sweet new worlds in 3D!\\u003cbr\\u003e•\\tEasy to play but challenging to master!\\u003cbr\\u003e•\\tPlay whenever, online and offline. Easily sync the game between devices and access full game features when connected to the internet. \\u003cbr\\u003e•\\tTake on this epic saga alone or play with friends to see who can get the highest score!\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eIf you need help and support, you will find helpful and extensive FAQs in our in-game Help Center, click the ? to launch it.\\u003cbr\\u003eShare opinions and have sweet discussions with other members of the Candy Crush Friends Saga community. https://community.king.com/en/candy-crush-friends-saga/\\u003cbr\\u003eVisit www.candycrushfriendssaga.com and discover delicious game guides and tasty blogs to satisfy your candy cravings.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCandy Crush Friends Saga is completely free to play but some optional in-game items will require payment with real money. You can turn off the payment feature by disabling in-app purchases in your device’s settings. \\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eBy downloading this game you are agreeing to our terms of service; https://king.com/termsAndConditions\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDo not sell my data: King shares your personal information with advertising partners to personalize ads. Learn more at https://king.com/privacyPolicy.  If you wish to exercise your Do Not Sell My Data rights, you can do so by contacting us via the in game help centre or by going to https://soporto.king.com/\"],\"King\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OV9T1SpLcXpYH-_03g8SvcOG0YLHxY0TEMmI0zReXAwWfMlDwMywf2vKKrb3UvlZuARgKLOplGDd7zxpVA_P\"],null,[33,54,73,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.king.candycrush4\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.king.candycrush4\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $99.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,nu