zG7DMhtPCYSLLcMVdRglOxBmzk_vphHi3daqVhR5SgtwwfIoY5-XyTdCSqr9GLH1GnjhQIg9EbEWZA7smwrGBjkbIXeRO91lSxot4HXo8MnTYNphB6rPJYXGhsPw_1qhDr41AAnamGBZw3m-6jXRR3IZ46DT7MZsydJugCu3P-52KU_NWFVA14A34r38py84eUKeLP_fPMUTUt0D_uhIcRa0xm8ohVfPP3LGXdNG11HtQiLsBmBLuvwSp8f5uWaezO_IFTf9r0VOTtxMnx2XRr4PueuAehNA\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/5mCTHw_2aDw/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Are you ready for the challenge, Knight Survivor?\\u003cbr\\u003eThe fate of the princess rests in your hands, but a fire-breathing dragon stands in your way! All-new roguelite skill experience\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 Core gameplay: slay dragons with masterful strategy\\u003cbr\\u003eIn Knight Survivor, every fight is a high-stakes chess match against unpredictable and powerful dragons. These aren\\u0026#39;t mindless beasts; they\\u0026#39;re cunning bosses with unique weaknesses and complex attack patterns.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e1. Dynamic dragon bosses: Every boss in Knight Survivor is meticulously designed with unique behaviors and fatal flaws. Mastering their patterns and exploiting their weaknesses is the only path to victory.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e2. Endless roguelike builds: Fusing the best of roguelike design, the game offers a massive pool of skills to discover. All-new roguelite skill experience with unlimited combinations\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e3. Strategic level diversity: Each new level demands a different tactical approach. Experiment with powerful skill combinations to carve a path through a perilous world and prove your strategic mastery.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔥 Answer the call, Knight Survivor!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHone your skills, forge your path, and save the princess. Survive the fun!\\u003cbr\\u003eYour epic journey begins now. Are you ready?\"],\"MOBIBRAIN TECHNOLOGY PTE. LTD.\",\"500,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-