.pimd\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003data.squid.pimd\"]],[\"qgJYGlYIRkoTCLXM77LHkJcDFSS6rAIdLhkZOPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCKgoUCg5hdGEuc3F1aWQucGltZBABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Virtually connect with your crew in an exciting student simulator! Throw a house party, collect exclusive swag, style your look, or just chill with your besties. Next, change up your aesthetic with different clothing styles and apartment decorations. You can even send fun digital gifts, adopt a cute pet, and build an unforgettable squad of friends!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy social avatar games with unique looks? Choose from a massive variety of popular styles to discover your exact vibe!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e★ DESIGNER DORM ROOMS\\u003cbr\\u003eCustomize your dream home. From chic VIP lounges and lux beach escapes to retro anime arcades, create your space then enter dorm design challenges for rewards!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e★ GROW YOUR DORM TOWER\\u003cbr\\u003eRent out rooms and hire dormmates to level up your campus status! Upgrade their skills and challenge other squads to a dance fight.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e★ 1000+ AVATARS TO CHOOSE\\u003cbr\\u003eLive your best avatar life: match your outfit to your room and style your look as a punk pop star, high fashion icon, whimsical princess, elite athlete, and more!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e★ ZODIAC STYLES\\u003cbr\\u003eElevate your aesthetic with fantasy inspired trends and furniture themed around your zodiac sign. Showcase a rare collection and outshine the competition!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e★ GROUP CHAT \\u0026amp; TEXT GAMES\\u003cbr\\u003eMake real-time community messaging safe and easy. Send emote stickers, play fun text mini-games, share your latest makeover designs, and stay connected with your Club.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e★ CHARACTERS AND STORIES\\u003cbr\\u003eEncounter comedic classmates, mysterious personalities, and entertaining rivalries to interact with as you rise to the top of the leaderboards.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e★ ADOPT A VIRTUAL PET\\u003cbr\\u003eBring home a cute pug, a sleek Sphynx cat, or a magical unicorn! Dress them in adorable outfits to perfectly match your avatar\\u0026#39;s style and show them off to your squad.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSchool is in session. Virtually meet your crew and make online memories together!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePLEASE NOTE:\\u003cbr\\u003eThis is an ONLINE casual MMO game. An active network or Wi-Fi connection is required in order to play.\"],\"A Thinking Ape Entertainment Ltd.\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/oxm5msXbt20vTrG2BnVn828p_sR6TUB2VlLLmgYC4HhAtEy3sh52iuOFwslEB_IXH7qzYGAmA5vItQS3ssq3gA\"],null,[195,122,246,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Mild Violence, Sexual Themes\"],[null,\"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xl04GurQer374yogi24hRkvUcXtMStMOcOo86Sprmrid9j6wQHF0d9xMh73CwUEg57lbsGIwpOXgrJ927Q\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003data.squid.pimd\\u0026rdid\\u003data.squid.pimd\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKB