gIR0oTCLXM77LHkJcDFSS6rAIdLhkZOPoBFwoVCKDo5uHcwOmNQxIJCgVlbi1VUxAAugJECi4KKGNvbS5nb29kZ2FtZXN0dWRpb3MuYmlnZmFybW1vYmlsZWhhcnZlc3QQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAE\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"smF5Gn4y-CQ\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:smF5Gn4y-CQ?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:smF5Gn4y-CQ\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezk-MCre8sGluEIfJG3IICdkxhQp8i274Gd8qf-ylhf9SOeyvevs-0syucIFW8XCZYNRlAiyKaGWcvhpSWbLQ2Ol8GNIcXSNKu6JTqzywnYlD7RQCknUMG04fRzIEG56dj6leN_RkQsMySZMna9H1x1S9GpcoVjmkbgHJBcc1fi3H_D_1QiIbmpmB40DJOxxpQrBFiJrRICCOyzT8qNoPtLuU5JjDBks-UqyoAaBwGVOqkyVhVXI0HI6Nwg_F1jEiwt6tJUSjaBl-O7znIvf-lHwhpBgiUdc45VN7FFviLq0uA\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/smF5Gn4y-CQ/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Big Farm: Mobile Harvest is a relaxing farm simulator you can play at your own pace - with friends, family, and a farming community that\\u0026#39;s always got your back. Build the farm life of your dreams, one peaceful season at a time.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eRelax on your farm:\\u003c/b\\u003e Escape the hustle and bustle of the city. No pressure, no rush — just you, your fields, and your animals. Pick it up for five minutes or five hours, whenever suits you.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eFarming simulator experience:\\u003c/b\\u003e Plant, grow, and harvest your favorite fruits and vegetables. Manage your farm your way — every choice is yours.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eCare for your animal friends:\\u003c/b\\u003e A good farmer keeps their four-legged friends happy. Have fun looking after cows, goats, chickens, horses, pigs, and plenty of other cuddly companions.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eTeam up with your farming family:\\u003c/b\\u003e Join a co-op with friends, family, or fellow farmers — help each other out, chat, and complete quests together. Some of our players farm with their spouse, their siblings, or friends they\\u0026#39;ve made right here in the game.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eFarm, harvest, and trade:\\u003c/b\\u003e Got extra corn but need strawberries? Head to the market and make a deal to help your farming village prosper.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eBuild your dream farm:\\u003c/b\\u003e Add vintage buildings, windmills, and decorations to make your farm truly your own.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eGrow what you love:\\u003c/b\\u003e From tropical fruits to organic vegetables, choose what to plant and make your farm village your own.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eFarming adventures:\\u003c/b\\u003e Take part in seasonal events and farming quests to earn rewards and discover new things for your farm.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eMore than a farming game — it\\u0026#39;s a community:\\u003c/b\\u003e Meet, chat, and grow together with a community of farmers who love this as much as you do.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBig Farm: Mobile Harvest is completely free to play with optional in-app purchases. You may disable in-app purchasing using your device settings. This game requires an internet connection. Privacy Policy, Terms \\u0026amp; Conditions, Imprint: https://policies.altigi.de/\"],\"Goodgame Studios\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/b-lNDSzTFDgoo0O4ZbpjcX8FDI5-0jZuEqBkGBkxDIm8JhCmQZzxfan2N-lVrSu2IZQyD2ZtfJi87Xdn7puG\"],null,[39,57,23,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.goodgamestudios.bigfarmmobileharvest\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.goodgamestudios.bigfarmmobileharvest\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $384.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.miramerge\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/rjx7d8xSKUhS_3ldL6TlXkN4PXh3u4lar8J31ZHCRUi5uXyhqD4GTJ9PqcZrWE-myBwE31Qm3Lp4PO48meSf-g\"],null,[112,187,37,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/32hE10TBs_jMOQEQJ30CGECkger1-6zzmO9DbhguINALcepByCwFmz-flt9w2t6EQuAb-f1PtILUTrwAvhcoVEk\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8lth6iPrn2sX7yhOv924cOyernu4zg9gQnVgXmN8O7e8c4_rmBjstXqEKaDDBwciN572S0KPtSy9NMHUtHZxDq4\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/TFx-Czv0ECkJQnX2DjN9QIRscAD5aJWgepNBEinZ5hCa0GUQj2rrn6TX7HWc0oiQwriBQPOU2Hdf_r8XbAyToQ\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/KwdiW_p3dIScofB1z8GpcGEoKtJ393RXBCwmq40VeenyvvhyohaT1X3wZ6V4TxSctqguK06GePcoDt8OBkgs\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5Q8lYLAwkcEV7ONF5qYW2_tE8eHNqgCm7yaXxkMksPyiQ9vGRJS7_zhR4z9vcLjmEzgobPyoI-V1dhtKO4X5aw\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/qqBaoeX1MAQ1