l,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xMqHAPLUpstwysiLVb-qAIKcc-MXErZJ_SCsW04cRpZaB3tXUSA4skAVsdvaWQoBdpCwhy7UqzEQ-Hqvhmhj9w\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/eTDz5J6TWPKumhBWJR5Pi7ZREk-fekFnCblA7ef4s1117ZgLeN1eBO46ql6ssy8Apw8uSQAw3koLtz6xIwmOwQ\"]]],\"Star Merge - Match Island Game\",[\"4.5\",4.468354],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.miramerge\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.miramerge\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.miramerge\"]],[\"qgJXGlUISEoTCLXM77LHkJcDFSS6rAIdLhkZOPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCKQoTCg1jb20ubWlyYW1lcmdlEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAB\"],[[[null,null,\"vCH0gEMaKWU\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:vCH0gEMaKWU?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:vCH0gEMaKWU\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezlnSP7aB3Xd6WMT43QZHRqc_OtfvvRm0S5tZEz9WfR4VxZiK1_dWZH0i1uO0tPcAwQjVOfzmexX__pQoKWXjRaRGZ3kVTK1iMN92P9klkIxNd_14-kVHm7kgoikvFNBAFS0ZYdRBXkPyrWI8xyY6OhXpw9FOgg-e80gnBAMVxV3IkhE4yVXM7y3lzDbahfLaPiakam05QvJ7I7IWaxdW-DnJsnXftBnIhJ-GmRmqoEc-L13i-k2CJY4yTt5usAnO0ql1gonQ71eXPKg-6mnX4FLrBLCQugl7knOg4k-0GA9VA\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/vCH0gEMaKWU/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Welcome to the hidden island of Sitaara—the home of the most relaxing and magical merge game. Once a proud seaside town full of mystical creatures, it has turned into wild lands in need of your merging magic! Match, merge, farm, build, and discover the hidden secrets of this lost island!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHelp adventurer Mira in this merge game: tame the merge magic, rebuild the island, and awaken magical dragons, fairies and wizards. Use your match and merge skills to turn ruins into thriving gardens and transform them into sources of magic power!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy the fun, story-driven merge game events and participate in cozy puzzle challenges infused with magic. Collect awards, treasure chests, and magic diamonds to help you savor this relaxing and cozy puzzle game. Whether you\\u0026#39;re expanding your garden, upgrading your farm, or unlocking a new area of the island, there\\u0026#39;s always something enchanting to do!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStar Merge game stands out from other merge 3 puzzle games by mixing in farm resource management, gardening, cozy atmosphere, and a rich story line with intriguing character arcs that provide great fun. It’s a whole world full of magic, mystery, and exciting merge games! As Mira would say: “Merge on!”\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMagical Match \\u0026amp; Merge Game\\u003cbr\\u003e• Match, merge, and combine everything you see on the island map!\\u003cbr\\u003e• Merge three items to get more powerful ones: turn seedlings into garden plants, farm houses into mansions!\\u003cbr\\u003e• Mix ingredients from your merge garden and cook delicious food with a sprinkle of magic.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Keep merging, and you can invoke powerful spirits and even your very own magic companion, raising them from an egg to a dragon!\\u003cbr\\u003e• The more you match and merge, the more your island flourishes—turning wild lands into a breathtaking garden of wonders!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGarden, Farm \\u0026amp; Trade\\u003cbr\\u003e• Sitaara is a seaside island paradise full of mystical resources you can turn into a cozy farm or garden!\\u003cbr\\u003e• Merge bushes to produce fruits and farm vegetables and turn them into delicious recipes using match and merge mechanics.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Don’t forget to water your plants and grow a cozy garden and farm.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Expand and grow your seaside town by trading with foreign lands, ever hungry for the unique products of your farm and garden.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Uncover lost magic, and bring back hidden treasures that make your merge journey even more exciting.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Turn abandoned lands into a thriving farm and transform forgotten island ruins into a peaceful cozy town!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUnlock Magic \\u0026amp; Meet Fantastic Creatures\\u003cbr\\u003e• With every match and merge, unlock Sitaara’s hidden secrets and lost magic!\\u003cbr\\u003e• Become friends with dragons, mermaids, and merge animals to grow them into majestic creatures like phoenixes, magic deer, and enchanted unicorns!\\u003cbr\\u003e• From dragons and kitsune foxes to cats and bunny pets, your cozy island is filled with surprises!\\u003cbr\\u003e• The more you merge, the more creatures you unlock—build a magical garden where they can thrive! Step up your merge game!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCozy \\u0026amp; Relaxing Merge Game\\u003cbr\\u003e• Star Merge game is a perfect fit for cozy game lovers!\\u003cbr\\u003e• Enjoy its nature vibes, lovable characters, running a cozy garden and farm—a true escape into a magical island paradise.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Solve relaxing merge game puzzles and bring harmony to the once-forgotten island.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Who knew a puzzle farm game could be so cozy?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFollow Star Merge game on social platforms for extra fun, games and bonuses!\\u003cbr\\u003eFacebook - https://www.facebook.com/StarMerge\\u003cbr\\u003eInstagram - https://www.instagram.com/starmerge.game\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBy downloading and using Star Merge game, you agree to the Terms of Use at https://www.plummygames.com/terms.html\\u003cbr\\u003eand the Privacy Policy at https://www.plummygames.com/privacy.html\\u003cbr\\u003eUninstalling Star Merge game during the update process can cause game progress loss. If troubles arise, contact us: help@plummygames.com\"],\"Plummy Games OU\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"h