null,\"AXH1ezkDDv3AOgISkrduoIfw2Vw6SUAv7XE3KaJtuQHUSuS2FsNaPOjbSjP9ZIaaKpnOVWbQStbbYaKqeWOSRPp4s4AIZJtS3J-F-uCgYLhr9UQM3yEKlQvFwGkyG9tNu7hinMPRjhUV1scpk33l99U9m_0Qcc8PRcSV0bZ3akrlkRJHBUIcFutY0J2dzXfTHZA_d8j-CgrZxMu9TmXao8I8aqgRoLFmxvg1AcnZiW5pZ9hy41XYbUr8QM7jsmM3OujocNmoVlw9m6DDnzTIendfb6nQCalqVLxDNIxqVQztgB0U1g\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/uB4Othe0Dhg/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Step into Animal Hunter : Wild Sniper and take the shot that changes everything. Built for players who want more than slow, repetitive missions, this hunting experience combines stalking wild animals across detailed environments with high-pressure sniper duels that reward timing, accuracy, and control.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e  Travel through forests, open plains, rocky slopes, and rough wilderness where every location creates a different kind of hunt. Watch animal movement, react to distance and terrain, choose the right angle, and make every bullet count. The controls are easy to learn, but real mastery comes from patience, precision, and smart decisions under pressure.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e  When you want more intensity, jump into real-time sniper PvP and test your aim against other players in fast, skill-based battles. Outplay rivals with better judgment, sharper reactions, and cleaner shots. Whether you are hunting wildlife or facing a live opponent, success depends on focus, consistency, and the ability to perform when the pressure rises.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e  - Hunt a wide variety of wild animals in immersive 3D environments\\u003cbr\\u003e  - Enjoy satisfying sniper shooting built around skill-based gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e  - Compete in real-time PvP duels against players around the world\\u003cbr\\u003e  - Explore living hunting grounds shaped by terrain, distance, and changing conditions\\u003cbr\\u003e  - Unlock weapons, upgrades, and flexible loadouts for different situations\\u003cbr\\u003e  - Join events, challenges, and seasonal reward content that keep the action fresh\\u003cbr\\u003e  - Improve your aim, timing, and tactical choices through every mission and duel\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e  Whether you come for the thrill of the hunt, the satisfaction of a perfect shot, or the rush of competitive sniper action, Animal Hunter : Wild Sniper delivers all three in one experience. Start hunting, sharpen your instincts, and rise through the ranks one clean shot at a time.\"],\"Counter Terriost\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/lUf5ix4B7JuSH8mJsukflPuNcWB2xiJfsBcA4vuLokebCs3lHnlhuIYYe4Rpon2-uMTqIA4ASBHLstdiyt6vsg\"],null,[149,152,152,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Violence, Blood\"],[null,\"In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xl04GurQer374yogi24hRkvUcXtMStMOcOo86Sprmrid9j6wQHF0d9xMh73CwUEg57lbsGIwpOXgrJ927Q\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.animal.hunting.sniper.match\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.animal.hunting.sniper.match\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $99.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,nu