zzles a fresh spin. Tap groups of colorful rubber ducks and send them onto a looping track. Match ducks by color, choose the right order, and keep the path moving without running out of space.\\u003cbr\\u003eThe rules are easy to learn, but every move matters. Release the wrong ducks too early and the loop may quickly fill up. Find the smart sequence, clear the obstacles, and watch every color slide perfectly into place.\\u003cbr\\u003eHOW TO PLAY\\u003cbr\\u003e• Tap to send ducks onto the loop\\u003cbr\\u003e• Match and sort ducks by color\\u003cbr\\u003e• Manage limited space and plan the order\\u003cbr\\u003e• Sort every duck to complete the level\\u003cbr\\u003eWHY YOU’LL LOVE IT\\u003cbr\\u003e• A fresh loop-and-sort puzzle mechanic\\u003cbr\\u003e• Bright rubber-duck visuals and smooth movement\\u003cbr\\u003e• Clever levels with new obstacles and surprises\\u003cbr\\u003e• Helpful boosters for tricky situations\\u003cbr\\u003e• Limited-time events and rewarding challenges\\u003cbr\\u003e• Relaxing gameplay with a satisfying sense of flow\\u003cbr\\u003eSort the ducks, clear the way, and keep the good times flowing!\"],\"MAXX GAMES\",\"10,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Lez2G2d-BGX7cKMOrvc3Edeo-bXEUTO4ddw58GgfG7eLtbb7XljLqWSJRt1kJmVhCp0o89uEEW9RpVQ9WqvX6A\"],null,[24,78,160,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt5