0b1SMmutpu6suFbK5n5QiPncVvq3nl-ENU\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/BdpEqTyiG29IyfzFNNF7yj3mKrgu5oXL7QZasmTpnth0gvtTbfArveWq6UftSqaQpbiYnOq_nGDVygN1iOGYuQ\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/9UA1BZzk02NDQcrufsCFCfsgsQXiHCibh2c4PS0V1HUIv0rMS6RXKxjdnKjsyILdFQjcZNmPmzcnoB8FoYIZ1Q\"]],[null,2,[633,1132],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ldnudq3cRee2-WTs3ZSYzPw5yIERKhUKIzvKqEGQmPXLebATUTshGXQ7Uu2sHuSkl7x9IYb3DChlLw9NVTZH7A\"]]],\"Family Farm Seaside®\",[\"4.2\",4.2090907],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.funplus.familyfarm\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.funplus.familyfarm\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.funplus.familyfarm\"]],[\"qgJgGl4IT0oTCLXM77LHkJcDFSS6rAIdLhkZOPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCMgocChZjb20uZnVucGx1cy5mYW1pbHlmYXJtEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAB\"],[[[null,null,\"AUtGGD6yOBw\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:AUtGGD6yOBw?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:AUtGGD6yOBw\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1eznGbdw54RjsH6V7TLjvlN4JPNORV4fQ5VmCdAMglbTNZ9KxmD5efpy9MaVAkcakcckpOqS1hITYh_uAJqdB34M7Rnt6KanYlMptqYPTLpIjScNBBC7-JfbRb8oy-FjmLMwLMJ6Kb9Kgb7h6t0_UOshvlWnNfu919YwtlWjdjdU0EPBFczofHidetpUy-v9eXXpXX9BJ2LbQ_RRoS4n0OD3I7KoV2mJLI4Zrnw3pFXGlt_U4SRfL06_nMHwtaTO4jnu4AV7yahNm2oPXQEnKBOtMj7OU51aztoWgjsLRBBJhpw\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/AUtGGD6yOBw/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Get Ready for the Holidays with Google Play’s Festive Updates\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBeautiful and fun farming simulation game. Raise cute farm animals and harvest diverse crops to make your farm a success! It\\u0026#39;s up to you to make your dream farm by the seaside. \\u003cb\\u003eStart building your dream farm now. \\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e■■ Game Features ■■\\u003cbr\\u003e✓ Played by over 60 million people all around the world!\\u003cbr\\u003e✓ Tired of upgrading the Barn? Enjoy unlimited Barn space.\\u003cbr\\u003e✓ Prepare more than 600+ dishes in the kitchen. \\u003cbr\\u003e✓ Plant, harvest and produce over 300+ unique products!\\u003cbr\\u003e✓ Compete with other farmers in the new Farm Beauty Contest!\\u003cbr\\u003e✓ Daily orders and new missions added regularly for more fun!\\u003cbr\\u003e✓ 500+ unique, cute, and well-designed decorations!\\u003cbr\\u003e✓ Adopt pets and costume them with pet apparel and equipment. Now you can breed pets to make new baby pets!\\u003cbr\\u003e✓ Exotic Island Farm: Explore a Mine, Garden! \\u003cbr\\u003e✓ Marine Sea Resort: You are now the owner of the Sea Resort! Complete resort orders and build the best resort for visitors to come to!\\u003cbr\\u003e✓ Visit neighbors\\u0026#39; farms and sample their newest dishes to earn prizes, help clean decorations, and trade for needed farm products!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFamily Farm Seaside supports 21 languages including; English, Arabic, Dutch, French, German, Indonesian, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian Bokmål, Persian, Polish, Portuguese, Russian, Spanish, Swedish, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e※ Product Usage Details \\u003cbr\\u003e- Recommended Specifications: CPU Quad core 2.3GHz, Ram 2GB\\u003cbr\\u003e- Minimum Specifications: CPU Quad core 1.5GHz, Ram 1GB\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e※ Access permission notice for gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003eSTORAGE: The permission is required to store game data and will not access personal files such as photos.\\u003cbr\\u003ePHONE: The permission is required to proceed with in-game events and rewards and will not affect calls.\\u003cbr\\u003eCONTACTS: The permission is required to sync your friend list and Google Account.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e※ App Notes\\u003cbr\\u003e- This app requires an active internet connection to play. Please make sure your device is connected while playing.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Family Farm Seaside is completely free to download and free to play. However, some items in the game can be purchased with real money. If you don\\u0026#39;t want to use this feature, please disable in-app purchases in your device\\u0026#39;s settings.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e※ Contact Us!\\u003cbr\\u003e- \\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://www.google.com/url?q\\u003dhttps%3A%2F%2Fcenturygames.helpshift.com%2Fa%2Ffamily-farm-seaside%2F\\u0026amp;sa\\u003dD\\u0026amp;sntz\\u003d1\\u0026amp;usg\\u003dAOvVaw3NUQ8fPXm3hg--g8e0t-Pi\\\"\\u003eFamily Farm Seaside Customer Support:\\u003c/a\\u003e https://centurygames.helpshift.com/a/family-farm-seaside/\\u003cbr\\u003e- \\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://www.google.com/url?q\\u003dhttps%3A%2F%2Fwww.centurygames.com%2Fprivacy-policy%2F\\u0026amp;sa\\u003dD\\u0026amp;sntz\\u003d1\\u0026amp;usg\\u003dAOvVaw0k88F4z5yoGgC4jA-zKdqI\\\"\\u003e Privacy Policy:\\u003c/a\\u003e https://www.centurygames.com/privacy-policy/\"],\"Century Games PTE. LTD.\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/DPy4LkEA8sp2rM4_GNsq5SJsb299iJeguUD-36bbP_b1QdQw4lz47aiBOx4NfeFFwpvikLUbs60u6kbm73RUSg\"],null,[230,201,116,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[