yi72O0ie2VU7qkvedkpZ-mEdDkigoMR8hpt9A6TED1sMM1FMiZEKkiauxlnD4kr53Pz35_g\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/eyciQ9QlecTMEN7xXeIk4tD56Mh4S9WjVt48vqhS6i7L8viq3i6qDh1cDgXhcRQ2SIrDbw7Gjf6Og94t2JCr4_Q\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/D-zK1eKgkrppe_GRpVWIg8KSYrnyQ0JH-QEnGEASDoYgG2RCfoGXdlgnGSc6o-siGx8gviYOMVaKQlbVsq_L\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/g2JZcmqZQJx8jRWu-HNDp93mPkLcB4NZmv-2vZTH6wO7UG8irmQ9nbpMHwzB8EhJOq5OS_MOXJZXyp3BDUsD-g\"]]],\"Pets Harbor: Merge \\u0026 Restore\",[\"4.8\",4.7909093],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.mergegames.petsharbor\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.mergegames.petsharbor\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.mergegames.petsharbor\"]],[\"qgJjGmEIUUoTCLXM77LHkJcDFSS6rAIdLhkZOPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNQofChljb20ubWVyZ2VnYW1lcy5wZXRzaGFyYm9yEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAB\"],null,[null,\"Merge puzzle items, 🐾 rescue stray pets, 🏖️ restore your coastal harbor resort, and 🔍 uncover hidden betrayal secrets in Pets Harbor: Merge \\u0026amp; Restore! 🌟\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌊 She fell into the deep sea, destined to die—but opened her eyes to find herself back a year in the past. Her fiancé and best friend seem loyal and loving, yet Lily carries terrible memories: ten‑months from now, they will push her off the cliff. This second chance is hers to fight back. Now, merge, restore, rescue stray animals, renovate the run‑down harbor resort, piece together the hidden truth of 30‑year‑old secrets, and reclaim her life step by step.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏖️ Merge \\u0026amp; Rebuild Gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy relaxing merge puzzle gameplay to craft food, drinks, beauty items, etc. Fulfill resort guest orders, collect stars and gain restoration energy to rebuild your dream coastal resort.\\u003cbr\\u003e🧩 Merge various items on the puzzle board to complete daily guest orders\\u003cbr\\u003e⭐ Earn stars and experience to renovate abandoned resort areas\\u003cbr\\u003e🏗️ Restore and upgrade your coastal resort with earned stars to unlock new areas and features\\u003cbr\\u003e😌 Enjoy stress-free casual merge gameplay with smooth progression and endless fun\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🐾 RESCUE PETS \\u0026amp; RESTORE THE HARBOR SHELTER\\u003cbr\\u003eRebuild your coastal resort with collected stars, create warm pet shelters, and rescue lovely stray pets. Turn your ruined harbor into a cozy pet paradise.\\u003cbr\\u003e🏡 Restore resort landscapes, build safe habitats and warm shelters to rescue lovely animals\\u003cbr\\u003e🎨 Decorate unique pet zones and create a warm pet sanctuary\\u003cbr\\u003e💖 Every resort upgrade brings more rescued pets and joyful scenes\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💙 Rebirth Revenge \\u0026amp; Mystery Story\\u003cbr\\u003eFollow Lily’s immersive rebirth journey. As you rebuild the resort and rescue pets, gradually uncover the hidden betrayal truth and thrilling story twists.\\u003cbr\\u003e📖 Unlock new story chapters while expanding your coastal resort\\u003cbr\\u003e🔍 Explore town secrets and reveal the buried conspiracy behind Lily’s tragedy\\u003cbr\\u003e👥 Interact with vivid townsfolk and collect hidden clues\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Experience a touching story of rebirth, revenge and self-redemption\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Relaxing Game \\u0026amp; Rich Rewards\\u003cbr\\u003eMerge, build and rescue at your own pace! Enjoy relaxing puzzle gameplay, stunning coastal resort scenery, immersive pet habitat building and constantly updated themed events with generous rewards.\\u003cbr\\u003e🎁 Complete daily tasks and guest orders to gain massive rewards, including stars, diamonds, energy and treasure chests\\u003cbr\\u003e🆕 Experience brand-new monthly themed events and fresh gameplay, with limited challenges bringing extra abundant bonuses\\u003cbr\\u003e🔗 Seamlessly blend merge puzzle, resort renovation, pet rescue and gripping rebirth revenge storyline\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💫 While everyone believes you are busy preparing for your wedding, you are preparing for your rebirth. Download Pets Harbor: Merge \\u0026amp; Restore now. Start your merge, rescue and truth‑seeking journey today!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e📧 Contact Support: petsharborcs@outlook.com\\u003cbr\\u003e🔒 Privacy Policy:https://sites.google.com/view/petsharbormergerestore/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\\u003cbr\\u003e📜 Terms of Service:https://sites.google.com/view/petsharbortermsofservice/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\"],\"Merge story\",\"500,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5KCRxA4hxpXF7KnozQ8ppspGmFSyjcSVTm7Uee8UiK7YqZmxWy7rJJA0BuTibwKh2E6RwYd9TYkNcf2cnVSfGLc\"],null,[208,247,243,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.mergegames.petsharbor\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.mergegames.petsharbor