003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dbus.loop.traffic.jam.fever.bus.puzzle\"]],[\"qgJvGm0IVEoTCLXM77LHkJcDFSS6rAIdLhkZOPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCQQorCiVidXMubG9vcC50cmFmZmljLmphbS5mZXZlci5idXMucHV6emxlEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAB\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to Bus Loop:Jam Master, a fun and addictive traffic puzzle game where you control the flow and solve challenging road situations.\\u003cbr\\u003eTap to send buses into the loop, pick up passengers, and manage the traffic system. This casual brain game combines simple controls with strategic thinking — perfect for players who enjoy puzzle solving and traffic control games.\\u003cbr\\u003e Addictive Puzzle Gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003ePlan your moves and solve each traffic jam puzzle by sending buses at the right time. Every tap matters!\\u003cbr\\u003e Dynamic Traffic Control\\u003cbr\\u003eExperience a lively bus traffic system with moving vehicles, waiting passengers, and evolving patterns. Keep the loop running smoothly and avoid congestion.\\u003cbr\\u003eEasy to Play, Hard to Master\\u003cbr\\u003eA true casual puzzle game — simple tap controls, but requires timing, logic, and smart decisions to win.\\u003cbr\\u003eSatisfying Flow Experience\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy smooth animations and relaxing visuals while solving loop puzzles and clearing traffic jams.\\u003cbr\\u003e Hundreds of Levels\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom easy starts to complex challenges, each level tests your ability to manage traffic flow and solve puzzles efficiently.\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you love traffic games, jam solving puzzles, or relaxing brain teasers,Bus Loop:Jam Master is the perfect choice.\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload now and become a master of traffic control!\"],\"Shoyo Mobi Tech Limited-Marble\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/MauEym66bThv-Dt7ggqg9TxNsnwuTo