w\"]],[null,2,[1440,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/rFjorEIzZoN1YF-hjzh9heq4aF0_vOJLQdPyvGFILkCWHY8iLSaT72WoWeIGUgco4G5wJrYiCelwQau3IN-7\"]]],\"3D Bolt Master®: Screw Master®\",[\"4.8\",4.8284035],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.screw3d.match.nuts.bolts.pin.jam.away.puzzle\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.screw3d.match.nuts.bolts.pin.jam.away.puzzle\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.screw3d.match.nuts.bolts.pin.jam.away.puzzle\"]],[\"qgJ6GngIV0oTCLXM77LHkJcDFSS6rAIdLhkZOPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCTAo2CjBjb20uc2NyZXczZC5tYXRjaC5udXRzLmJvbHRzLnBpbi5qYW0uYXdheS5wdXp6bGUQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAE\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"jp6soL3YXco\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:jp6soL3YXco?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:jp6soL3YXco\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezkP9nDyLPFo3uhS_XwrsLoWFrvzFpMXQS0oDDgVpYbeeB5wD3DMIOqndZ_XmeRg6emcwmOY_tJQjFcf6J4hclbfztHqVh-ACKbGUGG3x5yKYasZHbXWeoBb8cN7rekqJxZOy6ywupzaC8BSSDjvJ7KnjAlG4vV_LeD-TkcBQtdDVdVBuIUk3cwDk1Vg7RK8Q1LwItz2qVdABL25jwNHpRjYGDfgM4xKr1dlolZeM0aUAoP-y2C-NT9OPEaJ70U5SFigV6Cjs01iaGlcn2HmsJ9ywXBgxRbiH7wisMLZTqFGiw\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/jp6soL3YXco/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"😰 \\u003cb\\u003e\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\\"#FF0000\\\"\\u003eFeeling stuck in a long day, scrolling without a real break?\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e😄 Welcome to 3D Bolt Master®. It is a 3D screw game about observation, color matching, and planning the right order of moves. Rotate detailed 3D objects, find the screws holding each part in place, and sort every screw into a box of the same color. Simple controls and an unhurried pace make it easy to play a level during a short break.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 \\u003cb\\u003e\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\\"#FF0000\\\"\\u003eGame Highlights\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🟣🔶 \\u003cb\\u003eColor-Blind Friendly Options\\u003c/b\\u003e 🟦🔺\\u003cbr\\u003e・Unique icons and patterns (△ □ ○) make it easy to tell screws apart\\u003cbr\\u003e・High-contrast palettes improve visibility and reduce strain\\u003cbr\\u003e・Quick and easy to turn on anytime in Settings\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🚫 \\u003cb\\u003eNo Annoying Ads\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e・A smoother ad experience designed to keep the good vibes going and your gameplay flowing\\u003cbr\\u003e・Optional rewarded ads — only when you want them\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎨 \\u003cb\\u003eVaried Levels \\u0026amp; Smooth Controls\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e・10,000+ levels  feature different 3D models, colors, and layouts  \\u003cbr\\u003e・Realistic 3D models and rich colors that make puzzles satisfying\\u003cbr\\u003e・Smooth, responsive controls that keep every move easy\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧩 \\u003cb\\u003eEasy to Start, More to Explore\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e・Simple rules introduce the main screw game mechanics  \\u003cbr\\u003e・Early levels explain the basic steps one at a time  \\u003cbr\\u003e・Later stages require closer observation, careful screw selection, and planning the removal order\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏆 \\u003cb\\u003e\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\\"#FF0000\\\"\\u003eEvents \\u0026amp; In-Game Rewards\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎴 \\u003cb\\u003eCard Collection\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e・Collect cards and build your collection  \\u003cbr\\u003e・Complete card sets to receive in-game rewards and Royal Tokens  \\u003cbr\\u003e・Request missing cards or gift extra cards to teammates  \\u003cbr\\u003e・Complete sets to continue your collection  \\u003cbr\\u003eHow big can your card kingdom grow? \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🗝️ \\u003cb\\u003eKey Hunter\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e・Find keys as you progress through levels  \\u003cbr\\u003e・Use keys to open chests containing coins, boosters, and other in-game rewards  \\u003cbr\\u003e・Continue through the event to discover more chests  \\u003cbr\\u003eBecome a treasure hunter and dig into the rewards.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🟩 \\u003cb\\u003eCube Jumping\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e・Take part in a 100-player event  and stay in the race\\u003cbr\\u003e・Keep winning to earn your share of the grand event prize\\u003cbr\\u003eOne run. One shot. How far can you go?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎁 \\u003cb\\u003eDaily Gifts\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e・Log in daily to collect a daily gift\\u003cbr\\u003e・Consecutive login days may provide additional rewards\\u003cbr\\u003eReady to come back for more tomorrow?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💳 \\u003cb\\u003eGolden Pass\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e・Progress through levels and complete pass milestones\\u003cbr\\u003e・Activate the Golden Pass to unlock exclusive bonuses and extra prizes\\u003cbr\\u003eJump in early and maximize your in-game rewards!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🕹️ \\u003cb\\u003e\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\\"#FF0000\\\"\\u003eHow to Play\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\\"#696969\\\"\\u003eIn 3D Bolt Master®, your goal is to remove all the screws from a 3D object and place each screw into the box with the matching color.\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e・Rotate the 3D model and zoom in or out to find available screws  \\u003cbr\\u003e・Tap a screw to remove it from the model  \\u003cbr\\u003e・Place each screw into the box with the matching color  \\u003cbr\\u003e・Place screws without a matching box into one of the limited holding holes  \\u003cbr\\u003e・Plan the removal order so you do not run out of space  \\u003cbr\\u003e・Clear all the screws to complete the level  \\u003cbr\\u003eUse tools when available, plan your moves, and remove the screws one by one.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eComplete screw game, collect in-game rewards, and explore optional events in 3D Bolt Master®. \\u003cb\\u003e\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\\"#FF0000\\\"\\u003eDownload 3D Bolt Master® and start your first level.\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWant more information about the game? Follow us for tips, updates, and bonus content!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💬 \\u003cb\\u003e\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\\"#0000FF\\\"\\u003eFacebook Page:\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/b\\u003e https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id\\u003d61568990223133\\u003cbr\\u003e🧑\\u200d🤝\\u200d🧑 \\u003cb\\u003e\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\\"#0000FF\\\"\\u003eFacebook Group:\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/b\\u003e https://www.facebook.com/groups/2139433953224192/\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e📮 Need help? Contact us at Screw3D2024@outlook.com\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e📧 Privacy Policy: https://www.joymaster-studio.com/privacy.html\\u003cbr\\u003e🔗 Terms of Service: https://www.joymaster-studio.com/useragreement.html\"],\"Joymaster Puzzle Game Studio\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/uJ2HQzyRBUTlk1Jlpmngbvre9HNcMymtiuR0Yimz4aYTfKAYCITh3ai-TCPu9k1WsFf-c1qYTVpj1JKmvdGG\"],null,[233,232,230,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kUR