- Gold Diggers\",[\"4.6\",4.640264],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.fortune.btminer\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.fortune.btminer\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.fortune.btminer\"]],[\"qgJdGlsIWEoTCLXM77LHkJcDFSS6rAIdLhkZOPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tR0IQALoCLwoZChNjb20uZm9ydHVuZS5idG1pbmVyEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAB\"],null,[null,\"⛏️ Start Small. Mine Big.\\u003cbr\\u003eWelcome to Bitcoin Miner - Digital Gold Diggers — an idle tycoon game where you build a powerful mining operation from the ground up.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTap, recruit, upgrade… then sit back and watch your empire grow.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👷 Recruit Miners \\u0026amp; Multiply Your Power\\u003cbr\\u003eTurn a single miner into a full-scale mining crew:\\u003cbr\\u003e• Hire miners\\u003cbr\\u003e• Unlock high-efficiency Super Miners\\u003cbr\\u003e• Boost your hashrate (GH/s) for faster production\\u003cbr\\u003e• Grow your team for exponential progress\\u003cbr\\u003eMore miners \\u003d more power \\u003d faster progress.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⚡ Idle Gameplay That Never Stops\\u003cbr\\u003eYour operation keeps running 24/7:\\u003cbr\\u003e• Earn rewards while you\\u0026#39;re offline\\u003cbr\\u003e• Return to steady progress\\u003cbr\\u003e• Relaxed pacing with continuous growth\\u003cbr\\u003ePerfect for quick sessions or long-term play.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💰 Build a Smart Mining Strategy\\u003cbr\\u003eIt’s not just tapping — it’s strategy:\\u003cbr\\u003e• Balance upgrades and expansion\\u003cbr\\u003e• Optimize your mining efficiency\\u003cbr\\u003e• Choose where to invest for better output\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay smart, grow steadily.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌍 Expand Your Digital Gold Empire\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom a small tunnel to a global mining network:\\u003cbr\\u003e• Unlock new mining stages\\u003cbr\\u003e• Scale your production step by step\\u003cbr\\u003e• Grow into a true idle tycoon\\u003cbr\\u003eEach upgrade pushes your progress further.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎁 Reward-Based Progression System\\u003cbr\\u003eYour progress brings meaningful rewards:\\u003cbr\\u003e• Earn in-game rewards through mining\\u003cbr\\u003e• Unlock bonus opportunities and events\\u003cbr\\u003e• Optional features provide additional rewards\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 Game Features\\u003cbr\\u003e• Idle mining gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e• Recruit \\u0026amp; upgrade unique miners\\u003cbr\\u003e• Smooth progression \\u0026amp; satisfying upgrades\\u003cbr\\u003e• Offline earnings system\\u003cbr\\u003e• Tycoon-style resource management\\u003cbr\\u003e• Casual, relaxing, yet strategic\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e❤️ Why Players Enjoy It\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Easy to pick up and keep playing\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Continuous sense of progress\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Blend of idle + strategy\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Clear and satisfying feedback\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏆 Dig. Upgrade. Dominate.\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom your first miner to a massive operation —\\u003cbr\\u003eYour journey to digital gold starts here.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👉 Start building your mining empire today\\u0026quot;\"],\"Alpha11 Limited\",\"100,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yqGeG_-PQxYFhAWac-Dmq3oJAetqCUfpz_U8_P21Elqu07snSLH_BcC3v8ubhJ3wQzWPDl3KACh90eaWXqWf\"],null,[82,37,26,255]],null,[\"Mature 17+\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YX4IU7qLML-be7Xl25J-YkRBNgSZhVhJIsxeLdke3SaX1QBSFEKLbdcWORAwahq0oI4rrjz5YnWiVdb5\"]],[null,\"Cash Rewards\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,nul