and it\\u0026#39;s up to you to help them defeat him in this puzzle quest.  Grow and harvest the biggest Super Cropsies and stop Rancid from ruining the fun for everyone!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAdventure through this Farmtastic puzzle game while collecting as many Cropsies as you can! Help Fidget the squirrel collect his nuts, harvest adorable Super Cropsies and go on a puzzle quest to meet exciting new Farm Heroes. Be careful on your adventure and watch for Rancid Raccoon, he will pop up and try to stop you when you least expect him...\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFarm Heroes Super Saga features:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMatch 3 Games - Easy to Play, Challenging to Master\\u003cbr\\u003e• Fun game with Farmtastic puzzles with new game modes \\u003cbr\\u003e• Match 3 games with hundreds of levels for hours of fun! \\u003cbr\\u003e• More fruit and veg to harvest; grow the biggest Cropsies and will the Country Show\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFarming Fun – Switch, Connect \\u0026amp; More\\u003cbr\\u003e• Switcher gameplay – Match 4 fruit or veg to grow Super Cropsies!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eConnect to Online Leaderboards\\u003cbr\\u003e• Connecting online through Facebook lets you compare scores with friends on the leaderboards and save your farm adventure on mobile and tablet devices\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• Connect to the internet to unlock the full game features and keep collecting Cropsies\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTake on this Croptastic Saga and help the Farm Heroes bring harmony back to rural farm life in this fun match 3 puzzle game! Defeat Rancid Raccoon’s sneaky plan and grow Super Cropsies!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload today and start collecting Cropsies!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eVisit https://care.king.com/ if you need help!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFollow us to get news and updates:\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://www.facebook.com/FarmHeroesSuperSaga/\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://twitter.com/farmheroessuper\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://www.youtube.com/user/FarmHeroesOfficial\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://www.instagram.com/farmheroessuper/\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFarm Heroes Super Saga is completely free to play, but some optional in-game items will require payment. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDo not sell my data: King shares your personal information with advertising partners to personalize ads. Learn more at https://king.com/privacyPolicy.  If you wish to exercise your Do Not Sell My Data rights, you can do so by contacting us via the in game help centre or by going to https://soporto.king.com/\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBy downloading this game, you are agreeing to our terms of service: http://about.king.com/consumer-terms/terms\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHave fun playing Farm Heroes Super Saga!\"],\"King\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EXnBfKJpLjgDM41DRY0_IiVJ708c8UrA8hc1UC1EwYANwfO5oYyU8YvnNnI1nDDfrA_0GJAk3Bf0YmX7ekXDcAA\"],null,[63,237,246,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"Users Interact, Shares Info, Digital Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.king.farmheroessupersaga\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.king.farmheroessupersaga\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $119.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.gdrhrhw.utxdm\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/F6_T-1zZ3keJzbqWw5WuizhJB7V-UoJmu7bP4qXTfgamyfMlncCIe6hQ67bC8VD6SdIJ0mmiFuAbD85i5hgupQ\"],null,[74,201,255,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/gRsU2HK_G3Y1njrTOluH4ykCOkYwW113NEZz9OLDPtCIEjI2QItHcnqgu_IIu5-WM0Pr-L9snMwbyfjncNzhMek\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/WEQ-pV0jTTrY5NzgKaD8dX8Uc__OOg-znkzzm488diTNJyw1upBE-vGnUj12HcSiDKPZ55_wNNGc5kmc-DsMDQQ\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/9PYL4S6VMgKsGNaLo2Yfbj_84R61aZVyuDUYTNCtBJvecE8yn7vici1PnWLFmY9U9kkAcxVhHRd3E1XV1q1S\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/FKX9c77J_wFh2K3HdSQKv40rNDjnPcw80Y04S8d29dy_1V4GFimNdetMxd2BPaNQfm1PHVyMbwqwN7paNxh__4Y\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/QxCJPK22tu6hZZHJc98YDh9WpGkOWyGTqyt638GBs-eDEJCasGeasy_EOXFMjcbGDrvg3S-efUZrS0ubnzMV\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bUpXoM_AgSe1rEVZ3YJdCtmtSqDl_8iCyvDkKHmKH-R6iM2hNTS0-Cnkl-yF36Tp27DXquMC1m4iqZSWQB_8724\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/pjztdTqlupUizToi2Bx5AanKk72hutNMeNSwe3h1O3vYt3jaTBVW60mRC2ElVH2s1UTJYN1zcsrgQ3WuZbe3\"]]],\"Unravel Master: Tangle Puzzle\",[\"4.5\",4.534803],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.gdrhrhw.utxdm\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.gdrhrhw.utxdm\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.gdrhrhw.utxdm\"]],[\"qgJbGlkIXUoTCLXM77LHkJcDFSS6rAIdLhkZOPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCLQoXChFjb20uZ2RyaHJody51dHhkbRABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"🎉 ARE YOU THE PUZZLE MASTER WE\\u0026#39;VE BEEN LOOKING FOR? 🎉\\u003cbr\\u003eDive into the most colorful and captivating puzzle adventure of the year! If you love the brain-teasing challenge of games like Screw Master 3D and Screwdom, but are ready for a fresh, new theme, then Unravel Master is your next addiction! Get ready to untangle, strategize, and solve your way through a world of wonderfully tangled yarn.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧶 Unravel Master: Your Zen Wool Challenge! 🧶\\u003cbr\\u003eThis isn\\u0026#39;t just a game; it\\u0026#39;s a relaxing escape for your mind. Unravel Master combines mind-bending logic puzzles with a soothing, stress-free atmosphere. The challenge will test your brain, while the vibrant visuals and smooth gameplay will calm your soul.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌈 A VIBRANT WORLD OF COLORFUL YARN 🌈\\u003cbr\\u003eForget cold metal screws and bolts! Immerse yourself in a visually stunning universe filled with brilliant, soft lines of yarn. Each level is a unique piece of art, waiting for a master strategist like you to bring order to the beautiful chaos. Watch as tangled messes transform into satisfyingly neat patterns with every correct move you make!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🤔 HOW TO PLAY: Unravel The Yarn! 🤔\\u003cbr\\u003eThe goal is simple, but the challenge is immense:\\u003cbr\\u003eExamine the Yarn Object: Carefully observe the overlapping and knotted lines of yarn.\\u003cbr\\u003ePick a Pin: Tap a color of yarn and collect 3 of the same color to an empty socket.\\u003cbr\\u003eUnravel Strategically: Plan your moves to unravel the yarn one by one. A wrong move could make you lose the level!\\u003cbr\\u003eAchieve Perfection: Successfully unravel all the yarn to complete the level and feel the ultimate satisfaction!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ AWESOME FEATURES ✨\\u003cbr\\u003e🧠 HUNDREDS OF BRAIN-BOOSTING LEVELS: With a difficulty curve that starts easy and becomes fiendishly complex, you\\u0026#39;ll never run out of puzzles to solve. If you conquered Screwdom, you\\u0026#39;ll find a familiar and exciting challenge here!\\u003cbr\\u003e🎨 STUNNING 3D GRAPHICS \\u0026amp; RELAXING SOUNDS: Lose yourself in the smooth animations and a calming soundtrack. It\\u0026#39;s the perfect game to play to de-stress after a long day.\\u003cbr\\u003e👆 INTUITIVE ONE-TOUCH CONTROLS: So easy to learn, you can start playing instantly. But don\\u0026#39;t be fooled—mastering the art of the unravel requires true skill.\\u003cbr\\u003e💡 HELPFUL HINT SYSTEM: Stuck on a particularly tricky knot? Just like in top puzzle games like Screw Master, our hint system is here to give you a little nudge in the right direction.\\u003cbr\\u003e🏆 DAILY CHALLENGES \\u0026amp; REWARDS: Come back every day for unique new unraveling levels and earn amazing rewards to keep your experience fresh and exciting!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eReady to swap screws for string and become a legend of untangling? Your next favorite puzzle game is just a tap away.\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Unravel Master NOW for FREE and prove you are the ultimate puzzle-solving champion! 🚀\"],\"Supersonic Studios LTD\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/B1OPzEzXT9_9cwmykpRTUH8vbv-KIxhFAccT8eozluqRZ28mTcL_b7-p_Y2YBA1iWKwQUfJvCsIxOH3_lK_lJAQ\"],null,[2,130,223,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Violence, Blood\"],[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],