ature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.dvg.colorarrow\"]],[\"qgJcGloIXkoTCLXM77LHkJcDFSS6rAIdLhkZOPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCLgoYChJjb20uZHZnLmNvbG9yYXJyb3cQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Clear the way and set every arrow free!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn this smart, fast-paced puzzle game, each arrow wants to escape in the direction it points. Tap an arrow to send it out—but only if its path is completely open. If another arrow blocks the route, you’ll need to think ahead, rearrange the order, and spot the one move that unlocks the next.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eYou have limited lives, so every tap matters. Plan carefully, sharpen your focus, and clear the entire board to win.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFeatures\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSimple tap controls, surprisingly deep strategy\\u003cbr\\u003eSatisfying “chain reaction” clears when your order is perfect\\u003cbr\\u003eHundreds of bite-sized levels with increasing challenge\\u003cbr\\u003eBright, clean visuals and relaxing gameplay—great for quick breaks\\u003cbr\\u003eTrain logic, attention, and planning skills at your own pace\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCan you find the right sequence and help all arrows escape? Download now and prove your puzzle IQ.\"],\"DRAGONVALE LIMITED\",\"500,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/cx0zRza7TsItJF7dBLUdebsGaINuKy8BJBMrPgoQp-rzwybYyCwRSI8ppr1oaFygQuW6wN1MBiT6ZWD0gRAQNA\"],null,[22,21,55,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is gener