\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStella and her cats need your help to fend off the dark spirits that are plaguing their land. Travel the realm bursting as many bubbles as you can in this exciting bubble shooting puzzle adventure. Win levels and free Witch Country piece by piece. Play this epic saga alone or with friends to see who can get the highest score!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBubble Witch 2 Saga is completely free to play but some optional in-game items will require payment.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBy downloading this game you are agreeing to our terms of service; http://about.king.com/consumer-terms/terms\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBubble Witch 2 Saga features:\\u003cbr\\u003e• The next exciting instalment to the Bubble Witch franchise \\u003cbr\\u003e• New and improved game modes\\u003cbr\\u003e• Enchanting graphics that will leave you spellbound\\u003cbr\\u003e• Hundreds of magical bubble shooting levels – more added every 2 weeks!\\u003cbr\\u003e• Easily sync the game between devices when connected  to the Internet\\u003cbr\\u003e• Leaderboards to watch your friends and competitors!\\u003cbr\\u003e• Collect stars to unlock special items to help you on your quest \\u003cbr\\u003e• Special boosters \\u0026amp; bubbles to help you pass those tricky levels\\u003cbr\\u003e• Free \\u0026amp; easy to play, challenging to master!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eVisit https://care.king.com/ or contact us in game by going to Settings \\u0026gt; Customer Care if you need help!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFollow us to get news and updates;\\u003cbr\\u003efacebook.com/BubbleWitchSaga2\\u003cbr\\u003eTwitter @BubbleWitchSaga\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://www.youtube.com/user/BubbleWitchOfficial\\u003cbr\\u003ehttp://bubblewitch2saga.com/\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHave fun playing Bubble Witch 2 Saga!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDo not sell my data: King shares your personal information with advertising partners to personalize ads. Learn more at https